data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>。有序对使用固定可计算编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_x:=\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:(x,y)\\in T\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(T)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\subseteq T\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|T_x|\\le h(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_x:=\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:(x,y)\\in T\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(T)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\subseteq T\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|T_x|\\le h(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只在 f(x) 收敛时要求覆盖；迹的所有截面均有限。书的严格界 &lt;h 与这里 ≤h 通过 h+1 等标准重参数化对应，不更改可迹类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$，$h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]。有序对使用固定可计算编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"T_x:=\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:(x,y)\\in T\\}\\qquad(x\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CETrace}(T,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{CE}(T)\\land\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\subseteq T\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|T_x|\\le h(x).","display":true}],"bytes":1178,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea9cbc7f8cc8654f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Phi_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。$h$ 下式限于 $\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$J^A:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 由下式函数图定义。"},{"id":"657049ad6accfaac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$J^A$ 见 [[43-df-jump-traceable]]，$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]，$\\mathrm{CETrace}$ 见 [[43-df-ce-trace]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ce-trace]] — 可枚举有界迹"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104"]}